# User Stories

### Create Account

As an Owner,

I want to create a new Account with an optional opening balance,

So that I can start tracking my money in that account.

---

### Edit Account

As an Owner,

I want to change an Account's name or type,

So that it better reflects the real account.

---

### Toggle Account Visibility

As an Owner,

I want to show or hide an Account from Members,

So that Members only see relevant accounts.

---

### Delete Account

As an Owner,

I want to remove an Account I no longer use,

So that my account list stays clean.

